applies; the A3 page needs 43 to 63 s on this machine, and the abort surfaces as `page.screenshot:
Protocol error (Page.captureScreenshot): Unable to capture screenshot`, the line of the 4 failing
build tests. Every probe screenshot succeeds when it is given 60 s, and the PNG sizes are right.

Step 2: the probe fails its 30 s bar on the 2 A3 pages, so per the PM steps I stop before the code
commit and report. The fix is one line in the build script, outside this role's 6-file write scope:
`page.screenshot({ clip, timeout: 300000 })` (or a lower `deviceScaleFactor` for the A3 page with the
sharp resize kept). No test change is needed.

